CodeSystem: BodySiteCS
Id: body-site-cs
Title: "Body Site CS"
Description: "Body site supplement with translations in Uzbek and Russian"
* insert SupplementCodeSystemDraft(body-site-cs, $bodysite, 5.0.0)


